  "content": "\n\n<h1>路徑速度附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fpath-speed-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/path-speed-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>路徑速度</code> 是一種針對靴子的新附魔，共有三個等級，能在泥土路徑上提升你的移動速度，效果類似靈魂疾行附魔。</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品寶箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>獲取：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot path_speed_enchantment:&lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s path_speed_enchantment:path_speed &lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題或錯誤。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>建立自己的伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但使用 BisectHosting，只需幾下點擊即可擁有自己的伺服器！他們提供全天候支援與快速回應，絕不讓任何問題阻礙您！有興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%2